+.. rst:directive:: .. py:type:: name
+
+   Describes a type alias. The optional ``canonical`` option gives the type
+   represented by the alias; it is displayed after the alias name and parsed
+   as a Python annotation, so referenced types link normally. The directive
+   may also contain a description body.
